      "updated_at": "2025-11-03T13:52:20Z",
      "body": "Linking https://github.com/tracel-ai/burn/issues/2924\n\nThe reason is simply because gradients are not stored on the autodiff backend. The values in the tensor container for the gradients do not need to be tracked, so they are simply stored on the inner backend.\n\nBut I agree that this should be improved. Either via better communication of the expectations, or a more user friendly API.",
