      "updated_at": "2026-05-10T01:24:01Z",
      "body": "Both this and #2924 have been open a while (same root cause). VirtualNonsense's PR #2965 got pretty far before going stale. Probably a contained fix, I can patch it up? One quick scoping question. The prior thread had two directions:\n\n- Result-based API on the existing `Box<dyn Any>`\n- Make `TensorContainer` generic over Backend (sidesteps the downcast entirely)\n\nI can test both against the reproducer here to verify each closes both threads. Which one seems best? that way I can look into it further",
