      "body": "Hey @Capataina, thanks for following up.\n\nThe main UX issue should be resolved by #4717, which removes the backend generic from the user API. `GradientsParams` will no longer use `B::InnerBackend` to register grads and in turn won't require the correct inner backend generic to be used when retrieving gradients. It should just work.",
